   "collaborators": [],
   "text": "💡 Did you know that AI and a professional website work better together?\n\nMost small business owners think of these as two separate things.\n\nA website is your online presence.\n\nAI is your virtual assistant.\n\nBut when you combine them — something powerful happens.\nHere's what a complete AI + Website solution looks like for an independent healthcare practice:\n\n🌐 Your website — Clean, professional, and built to convert visitors into patients. Available 24/7 with your services, hours, insurance info, and contact details all in one place.\n\n🤖 Your AI voice agent — Answers every phone call 24/7. Schedules appointments. Handles common questions. Captures every lead that would have gone to voicemail.\n\nTogether they create a complete patient experience — from the moment someone searches for you online to the moment they book their first appointment.\n\nNo missed calls. No unanswered questions. No lost patients.\nThis is exactly what I build for independent healthcare practices and small businesses at Cynthia Townsend Advisory — done for you, start to finish.\n\n📞 Call Ava, my AI voice agent demo: (856) 347-3486\n🌐 cynthiatownsendadvisory.com\n\nWhich do you have right now — a website, an AI agent, or both? Drop it in the comments! 👇\n\nCynthia Townsend | Founder & CEO, Cynthia Townsend Advisory",
